rsonaname": "0samaBinLaggin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/n1tecrawler/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 995, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 248, "last_played": 1615830810, "avatar": "f47ec699dad064fe318f197be101a02b9d872749"}, "language": "english", "review": "classic", "timestamp_created": 1614454019, "timestamp_updated": 1614454019, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87559423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198152545117", "personaname": "GSP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PrayFORautism/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1916, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 554, "last_played": 1614865997, "avatar": "3d2e3b79df823f2a7ca530c50734c94fdf02e7dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "There are roughly 170 million insects for every person on Earth.", "timestamp_created": 1614451463, "timestamp_updated": 1614451463, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 7, "weighted_vote_score": "0.602318882942199707", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 12, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "87553547", "author": {"steamid": "76561198833978898", "personaname": "Un_Original_Name_196", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198833978898/", "num_games_owned": 85, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 6963, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2790, "last_played": 1616243021, "avatar": "743fabfb29a4853b0808f76b8ecddccdd50b2ae7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Seriously don't waste your time and money on this. The origin overlay is compleatly and utterly broken and I can't play the game at all thanks to the origin overlay. It just can't connect to my origins account for whatever reason and it won't let me play the game at all. Either buy it directly on origin, wait for the remaster, or dust off the ol' pirate hat because this ''port'' is unexeptable. Also 9 years later they still haven't fixed the hud scaling on higher resolutions. Otherwise it's a 9/10 as long as you have 5000 military strength and choose the destroy ending. Loses 1 point for that edgy bastard Kai Leng and a few other minor issues.", "timestamp_created": 1614444982, "timestamp_updated": 1615042640, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498157888650894165", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87517164", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081018260", "personaname": "CommieMilkMan", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Communist-Milk-Man/", "num_games_owned": 422, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 2817, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2771, "last_played": 1621073989, "avatar": "c9389dcfdfc0fe9d5205ffe16f35d4d955aa72bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you love playing a game for the story and not so much mechanics like shooting i Recommend all three of the trilogy. I just completed them with a friend over my shoulder and it was an emotional journey from start to finish even though 1 and 2 were better they all are worth a play through. If you can wait even consider buying the Remasters if you think they are worth it price wise. But the story is gold and i loved it so much. Since i just finished it i dont have words for how i feel it but it was amasing and il be looking forward to future games and perhaps even trying andromeda", "timestamp_created": 1614396890, "timestamp_updated": 1614396890, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87507974", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013217220", "personaname": "Aspergamer", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/japierniczedziala/", "num_games_owned": 918, "num_reviews": 246, "playtime_forever": 943, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 926, "last_played": 1614480225, "avatar": "ec8e907d199b1842795964342591c2d06eaeef26"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a weird game for me.\n\nI've finished both previous games about two years ago and I didn't expect a lot from this one, but it surprised me how enjoyable the characters still are. Sure, it is not as polished as ME2, the gameplay can be tedious, you can't skip many cutscenes which renders the game's replayability non-existant for me, and the endings are a big oof, so to say. It is also a game that presented actually interesting choices with results that mattered to me. \n\nIt is a game that is at the same time underrated because of its lack of polish and endings and overrated for the emotional aspects. I believe it is worth playing, but only after finishing the previous titles. Also, screw the DLCs, I wanted to play the Citadel because I heard it was a great time, but I couldn't get it to work on my save file and had to watch it online, which isn't really a bad thing since like half of the characters were dead anyway so many dialogue options would be absent.", "timestamp_created": 1614382404, "timestamp_updated": 1614382404, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522804737091064453", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}